url: "https://github.com/liguoqi-buaa/tce-input-organisation"
abstract: >-
  Per-sample malignancy probabilities for seven frozen vision-language model arms
  evaluated under six input organisations at a fixed visual-token budget, on 1,627
  smartphone images, plus the dermoscopic and colour-condition runs. Includes the
  scripts that render the input organisations and rebuild Table I of the paper.
